 "<footer>The total includes opened and broken chests. Wanted maps are counted on the first pickup from a poster.\nA dash marks a match saved by an older analysis.\n★★ = golden treasure hunt chest (cosmetic, shop access…), detected for sure.\n★ = treasure received from one of your own chests (exact moment), named when the item can be identified.\nPrize names can be edited in treasures.json.</footer>\n</main></body></html>": "<footer>Kogusumma hõlmab avatud ja purustatud kirste. Wanted-kaardid loetakse esimesel plakatilt võtmisel.\nKriips tähistab vanema analüüsiga salvestatud mängu.\n★★ = aardejahi kuldne kirst (kosmeetika, poe juurdepääs…), kindlalt tuvastatud.\n★ = mõnest sinu enda kirstust saadud aare (täpne hetk), nimega, kui eset saab tuvastada.\nAuhindade nimesid saab muuta failis treasures.json.</footer>\n</main></body></html>",
